{
  "slug": "data-agent-kit",
  "name": "Data Agent Kit Starter Pack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This plugin provides a specialized suite of skills for data engineers and database practitioners working on Google Cloud. It acts as an expert assistant, allowing you to use natural language prompts in your preferred coding agent to architect complex data pipelines, transform data with dbt, write Spark and BigQuery SQL notebooks, and orchestrate end-to-end workflows across GCP's data ecosystem.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **26 skills** and **12 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (26): `accidental-data-loss-prevention` (**STOP AND VERIFY**: Before running any command or tool that results in irreversible data loss, you MUST obtain…), `bigquery-ai-ml` (Leverages BigQuery's built-in machine learning and GenAI capabilities for advanced data analytics), `bigquery-bigframes` (Generates Python code using BigQuery DataFrames (BigFrames), the pandas/scikit-learn-style API over BigQuery), `bigquery-data-transfer-service` (Discovers and inspects BigQuery Data Transfer Service (DTS) configurations), `bigquery-graph` (Provides guidelines and best practices for querying and defining property graphs and semantic graphs in BigQuery using GQL…), `bigquery-sql` (Provides BigQuery SQL query optimization techniques, execution best practices, and performance tuning rules for high-efficiency querying), `building-data-apps` (Build modern data apps, dashboards, and interactive reports using either React + Vite or Streamlit), `data-autocleaning` (Automated data quality and transformation capabilities for Dataform/dbt/BigQuery pipelines), and 18 more\n- **MCP servers** (12): `notebook`, `visualization`, `bigquery`, `spanner`, `alloydb-postgres-admin`, `alloydb-postgres`, `cloud-sql-postgresql-admin`, `cloud-sql-postgresql`, and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install data-agent-kit-starter-pack@claude-community` from `gemini-cli-extensions/data-agent-kit-starter-pack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 37,
    "mcp": 11
  },
